        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions WST150030SMTSS4, 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Modern Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis custom 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Stainless Wasatch Pull is 30\" overall with 17-3/4\" centers.  This modern stainless steel pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Since it is made from stainless steel, it is built to stand up to high-traffic areas.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Wasatch Stainless Steel Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter:  1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length:  30\" Overall</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center:  17-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  Satin Stainless Steel</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 7 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the pull, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
